    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00abAwaken... rise and command the flame of chaos.\u00bb.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.poster.avif?t=1749873727\" width=560 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.webm?t=1749873727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.mp4?t=1749873727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARLY DEVELOPMENT RELEASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternis is still in the early stages of development, so many art assets are temporary, much of the gameplay is experimental, and localization is a work in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMITED ACCESS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternis's access is currently limited to those who have received an invitation to participate in playtesting.</p>",
